READ IN FULL: csrc/backends/cuda/sm_90/wgmma.cuh, tile_pipeline.cuh, warp_specialize.cuh, primitives.cuh (the cp.async ring). Map EXACTLY: the wgmma issue path (wgmma_mainloop_kchain, the per-N overloads, the descriptor builders make_desc_A/B_kmajor), the cp.async ring (TilePipeline, the producer/consumer setmaxnreg split), the smem operand layout (the cute Major-K INTERLEAVE idx). Output: the precise seam (functions/types) the CuTe GEMM must replace + the ABI those call sites expect (so the swap is local).` },
