AREA: grokking_optimizers/megakernel_codegen.py (Mamba emitters) + csrc/fused/sm_90/model_stage_mamba_tc.cuh + mamba3_layout.cuh + fused_mamba_megakernel.cuh. GOAL: mirror the DECODER flagship work for Mamba-3. Flagship Mamba dims = MODEL_SCALES_BY_MODEL['flagship']['mamba'] (grokking_race_v2.py — d=2048, L=24). (1) Parameterize the Mamba layout emitter + add mamba_flagship_layout_header() + --mamba-layout-flagship, existing layout byte-identical. (2) Generalize any 2/L-layer-pinned enumeration in the Mamba TC backward (fused_mamba_megakernel.cuh has MbDwSpec spec[8]; find its dW-spec builder + any LN/SSM per-layer tables) to mb::kLayers via formulas byte-identical at the current L. Use /workspace/impl_diffs/flagship_dw.md (decoder) as the template; Mamba's selective-SSM has extra per-layer state (A/B/C/D, conv) — enumerate those too. gate_commands: ['python -m grokking_optimizers.megakernel_codegen --mamba-layout > /tmp/m.cuh && diff /tmp/m.cuh csrc/fused/sm_90/mamba3_layout.cuh','python -m grokking_optimizers.megakernel_codegen --mamba-layout-flagship > csrc/fused/sm_90/mamba_flagship_layout.cuh','bash scripts/compile_to_object.sh csrc/fused/sm_90/mega_mamba_real_adamw_tc.cu -DWITH_CUTLASS -DSG_TUNED_GEMM_IMPL=1 -DSG_DEC_SCALAR_MEGAKERNEL=0 -DSG_FUSED_SM90_MAMBA_LAYOUT_CUH_=1 -include csrc/fused/sm_90/mamba_flagship_layout.cuh']. Spec -> /workspace/impl_diffs/mamba_flagship.md.` },

